From 981663b1922256a56bab4254c4baa79ef1729892 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:57:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: restore the redesigned player's artwork, lyrics, footer
 and controls hooks

Commit 977c7b7 replaced these four files with spoti.pw's versions, which have
no animated-artwork support (spoti.pw turns Canvas off on purpose). That dropped
the ImageViewProxy / Encore.ImageView hooks and the hold-still logic in
PlayerArtwork.x, the animated-artwork blur hand-off in PlayerLyrics.x, and
SGRSeekShareAt / SGRSeekTapLands that Player.h declares.

Restored from b34944f. PlayerMotion.x and PlayerSettings.m (Full Brightness,
Fit Artwork Size) are untouched.
